{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.992,"lines":[{"text":"Intro]","t":26.78,"e":26.98,"w":[["Intro",26.78,26.98]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Dans le secret de ton temple, je contemple ta grandeur","t":27.08,"e":34.1,"w":[["Dans",27.08,27.34],["le",27.38,27.46],["secret",27.62,28.2],["de",28.26,28.4],["ton",28.48,28.74],["temple",28.84,29.46],["je",31.62,31.88],["contemple",31.94,32.66],["ta",32.74,33.04],["grandeur",33.08,34.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as guéri les blessures, tu as apaisé le cœur","t":36.14,"e":43.02,"w":[["Tu",36.14,36.4],["as",36.5,36.64],["guéri",36.7,37.2],["les",37.26,37.54],["blessures",37.6,38.92],["tu",40.68,40.94],["as",41.04,41.2],["apaisé",41.34,42.04],["le",42.12,42.34],["cœur",42.46,43.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tes bontés se renouvellent, chaque matin comme un cadeau","t":44.9,"e":51.88,"w":[["Tes",44.9,45.12],["bontés",45.22,45.96],["se",46.1,46.26],["renouvellent",46.36,47.7],["chaque",49.38,49.66],["matin",49.72,50.5],["comme",50.58,50.86],["un",50.92,51.12],["cadeau",51.24,51.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as tracé le chemin, même quand le ciel était trop haut","t":53.94,"e":61.9,"w":[["Tu",53.94,54.2],["as",54.28,54.4],["tracé",54.48,55.32],["le",55.38,55.54],["chemin",55.62,56.38],["même",57.34,57.62],["quand",57.7,57.9],["le",57.94,58.06],["ciel",58.24,58.82],["était",58.9,59.54],["trop",59.62,60.42],["haut",61.7,61.9]],"ok":0.92},{"text":"Dieu de lumière, Dieu de justice, Dieu de toute éternité","t":62.98,"e":69.98,"w":[["Dieu",62.98,63.26],["de",63.36,63.52],["lumière",63.6,64.08],["Dieu",64.16,64.28],["de",64.46,64.62],["justice",64.74,65.82],["Dieu",67.8,68.1],["de",68.16,68.3],["toute",68.4,68.68],["éternité",68.76,69.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Devant ton trône, je m'incline, saisi par ton humilité.","t":72.1,"e":78.68,"w":[["Devant",72.1,72.58],["ton",72.66,72.8],["trône",72.88,73.4],["je",73.5,73.62],["m'incline",73.74,74.72],["saisi",75.46,76.1],["par",76.6,76.82],["ton",76.9,77.06],["humilité",77.2,78.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":81.7,"e":83.4,"w":[["Tu",81.7,81.94],["es",82.04,82.5],["Yahweh",82.56,83.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":86.24,"e":92.5,"w":[["Tu",86.24,86.46],["es",86.56,86.9],["Yahweh",87.14,92.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":95.28,"e":96.66,"w":[["Tu",95.28,95.54],["es",95.66,96.04],["Yahweh",96.2,96.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":96.66,"e":97.08,"w":[["Tu",96.66,96.66],["es",96.66,96.66],["Yahweh",96.66,97.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh, Alpha et Omega","t":99.82,"e":106.1,"w":[["Tu",99.82,100.06],["es",100.18,100.58],["Yahweh",100.7,101.74],["Alpha",102.94,104.12],["et",104.38,104.58],["Omega",104.74,106.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh, Alpha et Omega","t":108.86,"e":115.34,"w":[["Tu",108.86,109.12],["es",109.24,109.74],["Yahweh",109.76,110.76],["Alpha",112.06,113.08],["et",113.44,113.64],["Omega",113.8,115.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les montagnes se prosternent devant la voix de ton esprit","t":117.36,"e":124.36,"w":[["Les",117.36,117.52],["montagnes",117.64,118.6],["se",118.74,118.88],["prosternent",118.98,120.24],["devant",121.88,122.34],["la",122.42,122.58],["voix",122.64,123],["de",123.06,123.18],["ton",123.26,123.58],["esprit",123.62,124.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le souffle qui donne vie à ce qui était flétri","t":126.38,"e":133.3,"w":[["Tu",126.38,126.62],["es",126.72,126.92],["le",126.98,127.12],["souffle",127.28,128],["qui",128.08,128.36],["donne",128.44,128.72],["vie",128.78,129.08],["à",131,131.1],["ce",131.2,131.4],["qui",131.5,131.74],["était",132.16,132.52],["flétri",132.6,133.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as changé les ténèbres en un jour de liberté","t":135.42,"e":142.38,"w":[["Tu",135.42,135.68],["as",135.78,135.9],["changé",136,136.82],["les",136.9,137.06],["ténèbres",137.16,138.52],["en",140.02,140.26],["un",140.32,140.46],["jour",140.56,141.08],["de",141.16,141.32],["liberté",141.42,142.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Par ton sang, par ta grâce, tout a été racheté","t":144.52,"e":151.46,"w":[["Par",144.52,144.72],["ton",144.78,144.96],["sang",145.1,145.54],["par",145.68,145.88],["ta",145.96,146.12],["grâce",146.18,147.02],["tout",149.04,149.34],["a",149.38,149.58],["été",149.74,150.38],["racheté",150.48,151.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Rien ne peut te comparer, rien ne peut t'égaler","t":153.52,"e":160.38,"w":[["Rien",153.52,153.82],["ne",153.88,154.02],["peut",154.12,154.6],["te",154.7,154.8],["comparer",154.96,155.9],["rien",158.12,158.38],["ne",158.42,158.52],["peut",158.66,159.12],["t'égaler",159.22,160.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dieu fidèle, Dieu puissant, je ne veux plus m'arrêter.","t":162.34,"e":169.12,"w":[["Dieu",162.34,162.64],["fidèle",162.78,163.42],["Dieu",163.5,163.8],["puissant",163.92,164.92],["je",167.12,167.38],["ne",167.46,167.62],["veux",167.72,167.92],["plus",168,168.22],["m'arrêter",168.3,169.12]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":182.98,"e":182.98,"w":[["Tu",182.98,182.98],["es",182.98,182.98],["Yahweh",182.98,182.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":182.98,"e":182.98,"w":[["Tu",182.98,182.98],["es",182.98,182.98],["Yahweh",182.98,182.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":182.98,"e":182.98,"w":[["Tu",182.98,182.98],["es",182.98,182.98],["Yahweh",182.98,182.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":183.06,"e":187.52,"w":[["Tu",183.06,183.16],["es",183.26,186.64],["Yahweh",186.74,187.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh, Alpha et Omega","t":190.42,"e":196.68,"w":[["Tu",190.42,190.7],["es",190.8,191.24],["Yahweh",191.28,192.14],["Alpha",193.52,194.46],["et",194.94,195.16],["Omega",195.26,196.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh, Alpha et Omega","t":199.42,"e":205.6,"w":[["Tu",199.42,199.68],["es",199.78,200.24],["Yahweh",200.34,201.14],["Alpha",202.62,203.48],["et",204.02,204.18],["Omega",204.32,205.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Du passé jusqu'à demain, tu restes le même !","t":207.92,"e":212.2,"w":[["Du",207.92,208.06],["passé",208.2,208.66],["jusqu'à",208.76,209.22],["demain",209.32,209.82],["tu",210.76,210.94],["restes",211.04,211.54],["le",211.62,211.78],["même",211.88,212.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le Roi des rois, la source de tout ce que j'aime !","t":213.04,"e":216.78,"w":[["Tu",213.04,213.26],["es",213.36,213.54],["le",213.6,213.76],["Roi",213.84,214.1],["des",214.16,214.34],["rois",214.4,214.66],["la",214.74,214.9],["source",215,215.28],["de",215.32,215.42],["tout",215.54,215.78],["ce",215.86,216.02],["que",216.12,216.3],["j'aime",216.36,216.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es le premier, tu es le dernier, tu es le tout !","t":219.26,"e":222.68,"w":[["Tu",219.26,219.36],["es",219.44,219.52],["le",219.56,219.68],["premier",219.8,220.3],["tu",220.4,220.48],["es",220.54,220.64],["le",220.7,220.86],["dernier",220.94,221.44],["tu",221.54,221.64],["es",221.68,221.76],["le",221.82,222],["tout",222.1,222.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Nous nous tenons devant toi, à tes pieds, à genoux !","t":223.78,"e":228,"w":[["Nous",223.78,224],["nous",224.08,224.26],["tenons",224.36,224.88],["devant",224.96,225.44],["toi",225.5,225.72],["à",226.12,226.28],["tes",226.36,226.56],["pieds",226.64,226.92],["à",227.26,227.42],["genoux",227.48,228]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":253.8,"e":257.76,"w":[["Tu",253.8,254.08],["es",254.16,254.58],["Yahweh",254.68,257.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":262.62,"e":262.7,"w":[["Tu",262.62,262.62],["es",262.62,262.62],["Yahweh",262.64,262.7]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":262.76,"e":262.76,"w":[["Tu",262.76,262.76],["es",262.76,262.76],["Yahweh",262.76,262.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh","t":262.8,"e":264.74,"w":[["Tu",262.8,263.08],["es",263.22,263.7],["Yahweh",263.72,264.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh, Alpha et Omega","t":272.04,"e":278.14,"w":[["Tu",272.04,272.36],["es",272.48,272.96],["Yahweh",273,273.84],["Alpha",275.42,276.34],["et",277.4,277.58],["Omega",278.12,278.14]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es Yahweh, Alpha et Omega","t":278.14,"e":279.1,"w":[["Tu",278.14,278.14],["es",278.14,278.14],["Yahweh",278.14,278.14],["Alpha",278.14,278.14],["et",278.14,278.14],["Omega",278.14,279.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Alpha… et Omega…","t":284.36,"e":288.34,"w":[["Alpha",284.36,285.36],["et",286.7,287.2],["Omega",287.76,288.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Yahweh… tu es là.","t":288.7,"e":290.48,"w":[["Yahweh",288.7,289.24],["tu",289.82,289.98],["es",290.04,290.16],["là",290.22,290.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Rien que toi, Seigneur.","t":291,"e":292.74,"w":[["Rien",291,291.3],["que",291.4,291.58],["toi",291.66,292.04],["Seigneur",292.16,292.74]],"ok":1.0}]}